Third-party material incorporated in this repository
----------------------------------------------------

1. HID LampArray report descriptor
   core/src/LampArrayDescriptor.cpp

   The 292 descriptor bytes are reproduced from Microsoft's LampArray firmware
   sample:

       https://github.com/microsoft/ArduinoHidForWindows
       src/LampArrayReportDescriptor.h
       Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.
       Licensed under the MIT License.

   Microsoft's Dynamic Lighting device documentation points at that repository
   as the reference implementation, and the bytes were generated there by
   WaratahCmd.exe (https://github.com/microsoft/hidtools) from HID Usage Tables
   1.4.  They are reproduced rather than re-derived so that the descriptor is
   known-good; every item was cross-checked against the specification.

